# IMPORTANT ARCHITECTURE CHANGE — UNIFIED AI MARKETING & VIDEO STUDIO

The existing Viral Video Studio must become the foundation of a single unified project called **AI Marketing & Video Studio**.

Do NOT create a separate marketing-agency project.

Do NOT duplicate, reinstall or replace existing video production skills, dependencies or configurations.

Your responsibility is to extend the existing project with marketing strategy, social media management, content planning, analytics and publishing capabilities.

## Unified architecture

Create one central Marketing Director agent responsible for coordinating:

- Market research
- Content strategy
- Viral hooks and scripts
- Copywriting
- Existing video production workflows
- Social media scheduling
- Campaign analytics
- Performance optimisation

All agents must share the same brand configurations, campaign context, content calendar and approval queue.

